1159
01:22:34.113 --> 01:22:38.918
I'll tell you everything
if you let me see myself.

1160
01:22:39.718 --> 01:22:41.754
No.

1161
01:22:42.389 --> 01:22:45.624
I'll say whatever you want.

1162
01:22:57.703 --> 01:22:59.872
Candyman.

1163
