- Help.

1178
01:23:51.023 --> 01:23:52.725
No, no, no, no, no, no, no, no.

1179
01:23:53.826 --> 01:23:57.129
LIPEZ?
Holy <i>shit.</i>

1180
01:23:57.164 --> 01:23:59.266
What the fuck.

1181
01:24:08.908 --> 01:24:11.010
