1182
01:24:13.180 --> 01:24:16.216
<i>I am the writing on the walls.</i>

1183
01:24:17.917 --> 01:24:21.987
<i>I am the sweet smell
of blood on the street.</i>

1184
01:24:23.223 --> 01:24:27.227
<i>The buzz that echoes
in the alleyways.</i>

1185
01:24:27.260 --> 01:24:28.794
<i>They will say</i>

1186
01:24:28.827 --> 01:24:31.464
- <i>I shed innocent blood.</i>
- Anthony.

1187
01:24:31.498 --> 01:24:33.366
<i>You are far from innocent,</i>

1188
01:24:33.400 --> 01:24:36.068
<i>but they will say you were.</i>

1189
01:24:36.101 --> 01:24:39.206
<i>That's all that matters.</i>

1190
01:25:57.183 --> 01:26:00.253
Tell...

1191
